  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### Can we have automated recurring invoices?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 22 Oct, 2021 at  3:35 PM\n\n\t\tYes, \n\nPlease go to Bookkeeping > Sales > Recurring Invoices\n\nClick on + Recurring Invoice \n\nThe next page which will appear looks similar to the normal sales input\n\nTo set the repeating invoice fill in the Repeat After choose the amount and either weeks or months\n\nPlease proceed to fill out the other fields, as necessary. Then click save and close\n\nThis invoice will now be automatically created.\n\nIf you would like to change the date of the recurring invoice, you may delete the recurring invoice and add the new recurring invoice with the desired date. \n\nClick here to watch how to stop recurring purchases\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Can we have automated recurring invoices?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 22 Oct, 2021 at  3:35 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Yes,&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please go to <strong>Bookkeeping &gt; Sales &gt; Recurring Invoices</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click on + Recurring Invoice&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9142624761/original/eLa_2Gr8ilHs4_-sl614W2RVaGWpjoxB5w.png?1634912748\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9142624761\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The next page which will appear looks similar to the normal sales input</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9142624823/original/iGXAdQuLlyXcg_Ax2GdSdWN29L-4rtjxKw.png?1634912785\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9142624823\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To set the repeating invoice fill in the <em>Repeat After</em> choose the amount and either <em>weeks&nbsp;</em>or <em>months</em></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9142624967/original/mApRRk3kCQe59TPgtljzH7YflW1QhGcyAw.png?1634912864\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9142624967\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please proceed to fill out the other fields, as necessary. Then click save and close</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><spa